+
+    # Family 6 (`4` targets): True Two-Channel `Pi_s` (`2` adiabatic `[2.5, 5.1]` + `2` boundary quench `[2.24, 2.34]`!)
+    # Notice: on `[2.24, 2.34]` (`thermal`), Stage-0's unrevised box `[2.2, 5.2]` thinks coarse is valid while
